
# Day21 - Setting Up Git Repository on Storage Server

## Task:
Install the git package on the Storage Server using yum, and create a bare Git repository with the exact name and path /opt/demo.git.

## Purpose:
To establish a centralized bare Git repository on the Storage Server for remote version control and collaboration. A bare repository is required for shared access, enabling developers to push, pull, and manage source code in a structured and controlled manner within the Stratos DC infrastructure.
